{% assign faq_q_what_is = "What is Verta?" %}
{% assign faq_a_what_is = "Verta is a posture awareness trainer built around a simple idea: attention drifts before posture does. A precision gyroscope detects slouching in real time and delivers a gentle vibration reminder, helping you build the habit of adjusting your posture naturally." %}

{% assign faq_q_different = "How is Verta different from a posture brace?" %}
{% assign faq_a_different = "A brace forces your body into position and often feels restrictive. Verta takes the opposite approach, using gentle vibration feedback to build awareness, so better posture becomes a habit you keep rather than a position you are held in." %}

{% assign faq_q_who = "Who is Verta for?" %}
{% assign faq_a_who = "Anyone who spends long hours sitting. Remote workers, students, programmers, and gamers. If you catch yourself slouching without noticing, Verta was made for you." %}

{% assign faq_q_vibration = "How does the vibration feedback work?" %}
{% assign faq_a_vibration = "The sensor detects when you begin to slouch and responds with a gentle vibration. Over time, your body learns to associate the reminder with sitting upright, and the habit becomes your own." %}

